Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.69,0:00:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.07,0:00:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒事吧  羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起  我實在是太想看媽媽了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的  不用道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,來這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就差一點了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪  羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,白羽!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未睡了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  睡得很香
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,鏡子阿姨說會照顧她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好白羽也沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.35,0:03:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.43,0:03:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我們原本不就是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要改變你溺水的未來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,對哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,因為羽未遭遇了危險…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.86,0:03:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,果然你們是因為在我旁邊才會…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.83,0:03:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我和羽未都是想幫助你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.79,0:03:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你沒什麼好歉疚的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.83,0:03:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,白羽你能看到未來的能力是貨真價實的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:03:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我也看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,從水下看到  海面上漂浮的紅色的光
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.05,0:04:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,因為事前聽白羽說過  所以我才能冷靜下來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是這樣  但未來不會這樣改變
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,或許沒必要改變吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不必將看到的未來當做必然的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.86,0:04:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到的未來  只是一個契機
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之後還有未來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那一定是一個很美好的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,為此難免會有難受或痛苦的經歷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼想如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.30,0:04:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我從來沒有這樣想過
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,因為白羽你太善良了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,滿腦子只想著不給別人添麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才會變得孤單一人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不要說孤單了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:04:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但你已經不會孤單了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會再讓你孤單了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.49,0:05:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里真厲害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,未來不是結果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,而是通向更遙遠未來的過程
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼一想心裡就輕鬆了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.51,0:05:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不客氣  能幫上忙就好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在海中溺水的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,也是通向美好未來的過程
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.64,0:05:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,通向…美好的未來…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.39,0:05:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼了  白羽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那個  在海裡的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你趁亂親…親…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,親?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,親了我  對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那不是  親…親你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,應該算是人工呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.29,0:06:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,或者說是急救措施
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那不計數也沒關係嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,當…當然
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是說我的初吻還在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我的也還在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,現在可以做嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.19,0:06:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,初吻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,應…該可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.75,0:06:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,應該可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.29,0:06:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,應該?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,可以…哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那我失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我們剛做完廣播體操回來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.23,0:07:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎  太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.03,0:07:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,小白羽  好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未  捏著筷子可不禮貌哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嗚咪?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪  明明之前能好好用筷子的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,這是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我去拿勺子過來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,真奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,難道是昨天的後遺症嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,可是醫生說沒有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未  有沒有哪裡覺得痛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不痛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,看來不是受傷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不把邊折好的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就不能直著的飛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,嗚咪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.93,0:09:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我們一起折吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好漂亮的摺紙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,飛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,終極偉大超級媽媽的怒氣最大版
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,跑得這麼開心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,應該沒問題的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.33,0:09:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,對媽媽惡作劇結果被訓了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸被訓得更狠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是非常開心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.01,0:09:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,說到惡作劇的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,掀裙子怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,幹嘛這樣看我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,難得人家幫出主意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啦  我之前就在想了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.56,0:09:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,蒼真的很色呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我才不色
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,掀裙子嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:09:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有道理啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:09:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.82,0:10:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧  不是因為我很色
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.99,0:10:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不  蒼很色
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.66,0:10:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕是這座島上懂的最多的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,掀裙子是非常簡單明確
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要任何準備就可以做的惡作劇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.51,0:10:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我還需要心理準備
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.97,0:10:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸加油
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我打電話叫白羽來這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未  上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,蒼叫我過來的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,宛若夏日清風的細語…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.76,0:10:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你在生氣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我看起來像沒生氣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,記憶…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,只要打了就會消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,聽我說  這是有原因的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.02,0:11:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.28,0:11:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是被這個人強迫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,做了不想做的事情吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.74,0:11:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣…不對哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,被媽媽罵了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,變態
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有討厭內褲的男生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.65,0:11:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:11:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,內褲不過就是一塊布罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,遮住本身就很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.66,0:12:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼那兩人喝彈珠汽水喝得那麼興奮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,這不就是自作自受
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,話是這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但提出掀裙子的是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.67,0:12:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,說到底為什麼突然想對白羽惡作劇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是說過了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是為了實現羽未的繪畫日記
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.89,0:12:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好像確實…是為了小羽未啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,要不然我們不會幫忙做那種蠢事的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,小羽未  沒錯沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:12:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.97,0:13:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿著兩張哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.59,0:13:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,加藤…羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.40,0:13:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我在幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不對…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不對…不對…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒有忘記羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未  天亮了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,廣播體操要結束了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗚咪…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.01,0:13:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽  在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.68,0:13:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未  怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:13:59.15,Comment,,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.56,0:14:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.95,0:14:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.41,0:14:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我在這裡哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,抱抱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是行為退化了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,還是帶她去醫院比較好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要醫院
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:28.88,Comment,,0,0,0,,我很高興爸爸你是我的爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我感覺我好像忘掉了什麼重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,重要的事是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.69,0:14:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,8月24日  晴轉雨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,突然下起了雨  媽媽也淋濕了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,和媽媽一起洗了澡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.70,0:14:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真開心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:14:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未  有沒有哪裡癢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,再右邊一點
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.25,0:15:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,替換的衣服放在這了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸也一起來洗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,一家歡聚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.10,0:15:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  還太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,繪畫日記寫的天氣  說中了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.61,0:15:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不可思議呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.61,0:15:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,總覺得  在這個夏天作弊了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,作弊是指?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.99,0:15:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,因為你的要求  我開始扮演媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一開始覺得只要做做樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣也可以吃到冰棒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,冰箱了還放著很多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.84,0:15:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但是從中途開始就沒有減少了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:15:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,因為如果吃了冰棒  就感覺會變成假的了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,為了讓羽未度過一個快樂的暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.94,0:16:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,為了孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,這是一般體會不到的夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.40,0:16:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,作為媽媽的夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣的夏天  總有一天會到來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我卻作弊的先當了回媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說  白羽想趕快要孩子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,也許是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是像羽未這樣的孩子  我會很開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,暑假結束後  我會回我原本住的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但異地戀我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.77,0:16:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我會寂寞得想死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,真沉重
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那白羽能接受異地戀嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我會空虛得想死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.73,0:16:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真沉重
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.69,0:16:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,可能還會詛咒你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.90,0:16:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.99,0:16:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,只是誇張的說法啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.03,0:16:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那為了不被你詛咒  我會努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.66,0:17:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,努力?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,打工攢錢  每週末都來這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那種事怎麼可能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.21,0:17:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不如說  我想這樣做
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.05,0:17:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.51,0:17:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,明明知道你在說很荒謬的話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.39,0:17:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但我很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.52,0:17:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,這算約會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.23,0:17:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.85,0:17:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎  這就是約會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你第一次嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我上的是男子學校啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.61,0:17:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是第一次約會
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟你很孤單嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.45,0:17:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不要說我孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.79,0:17:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼我們之前一直沒有做過呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,約會
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道  是因為害羞嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:17:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,突然說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我只是設想一下應該沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,設想?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.14,0:18:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,比如說  就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我們要是有了孩子的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.65,0:18:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好色
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好色
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.77,0:18:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啊  不是那個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不要凶我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.36,0:18:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,只是單純的在想是生男孩  還是生女孩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,女孩?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.95,0:18:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,對  羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我們要趕快回羽未身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,確實呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.51,0:18:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直跟著我們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.19,0:18:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直在我們身邊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.32,0:18:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,拍照?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:19:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  大家一起拍張照吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  為什麼忘記了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,這個夏天  我不是決定要為羽未實現願望了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.63,0:19:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,和媽媽一起度過快樂暑假的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.76,0:19:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我連忘掉了羽未這件事都不記得了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.68,0:19:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗚咪…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未自己和爸爸說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.62,0:19:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣爸爸會比較開心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.42,0:20:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸也  一起  拍進照片吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊  一起拍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.43,0:20:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我們三個一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.85,0:20:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那羽未在中間
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.82,0:20:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再靠過來點
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.07,0:20:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那我要拍了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,來  茄子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那我拿去沖洗了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.12,0:20:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,洗好了馬上聯絡你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.08,0:20:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,到時候我們三個人一起來拿照片吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.17,0:20:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  如果又忘記羽未的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.55,0:20:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,明天就是煙火大會了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,這是這座島上一年一次的大活動哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.14,0:20:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,標誌著夏天的結束
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,夏天的…結束
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.61,0:21:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,羽未  我們一起去看煙火吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.03,0:21:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,煙火…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好  我很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.45,0:21:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,已經約好了  絕對不會忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,晚…安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.72,0:21:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.93,0:21:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,說起來  這繪本還沒有給她讀到最後呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,擁有美麗翅膀的蝴蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.02,0:21:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在沒有色彩的世界旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.78,0:21:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,它將翅膀上的美麗顏色
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,分給了旅途中遇到的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.57,0:21:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,即使蝴蝶的翅膀失去了顏色  變得殘破不堪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.95,0:21:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,它仍然繼續旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.38,0:22:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼會是這樣的故事呢
Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Comment,,0,0,0,,

